# Agent capture

Cursor project hooks in `.cursor/hooks.json` append every user prompt and every final agent response to `.agent-logs/`.

- Do not add `.agent-logs/` to `.gitignore`.
- Do not edit, tidy, summarise, or delete log entries after they are written.
- Do not log thinking, tool calls, diffs, or retries.
- Do not start product work until `CAPTURE-TEST.md` exists and both canaries are in the logs.
